/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig

# Speccy runtime state must never live in a repo. This is the defensive
# backstop `speccy install` also writes into a target repo's .gitignore
# (DESIGN § Git Policy); here it guards this repo during dogfooding.
.speccy/*
!.speccy/project.yaml
!.speccy/pack-lock.yaml
